      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I understand your feelings of being overwhelmed and insignificant. Considering that knowledge changes over time with new discoveries is a universal experience, as is your own life journey. Remember your contributions, they may have laid a foundation or inspired others, continuing to shape our world in unseen ways. Perhaps there's new ground to cultivate or unexpected paths to explore. And remember, you remain valued, even if it's just to the solitude of silent admiration.",
